The connection between predator and prey allows you to speak to the mind of your target and beckon them closer. For [7, 9, 10, 10, 10 (TL1-5)] turns, they will try to come to you, even pushing others aside to do so. They will move towards you instead of acting [25%, 33%, 39%, 45%, 49% (TL1-5)] of the time, but can save verses Mindpower to slow the effect. If they take significant damage, the beckoning may be overcome altogether. The effect makes concentration difficult for your target, reducing Spellpower and Mindpower by [12, 16, 19, 22, 24 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] until they reach you.

The Spellpower and Mindpower reduction increases with your Willpower.
